    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Veiled Blade Elimination Force",
    "summary": "Restricted to CALLIDUS ASSASSIN models. Up to two times per battle, during a Movement phase of yours, pick another INFANTRY model of yours that is deployed on the battlefield and outside Engagement Range of all enemy units. Destroy that model; rules triggered by a model's destruction do not apply. Remove this model and set it up again as near as possible to the destroyed model's position, outside Engagement Range of all enemy units. This cannot happen more than once in a battle round.",
